sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 用户或系统
    participant UI as MessageV4
    participant Port as CommandPort
    participant Helix as Helix IM
    participant Infra as HTTP/WS/SQLite
    participant Runtime as SurfaceRuntime

    User->>UI: 群设置、关闭/退出确认、属性修改
    UI->>Port: confirmGovernanceAction/updateGroupSettings -&gt; im_channel_close / im_channel_leave / im_channel_change_*
    Port->>Helix: im_channel_close / im_channel_leave / im_channel_change_display_name / im_channel_change_notice / im_channel_change_info
    Helix->>Infra: Effect batch
    Infra-->>Helix: PersistOk / authority result
    Helix-->>Runtime: InteractionFrameV2 (message.channel-summary / message.member-roster)
    Runtime-->>UI: atomic typed VM publish
    Runtime-->>Helix: FrameApplied
